## catch genérico mascara erro original

catch {
  throw new ApiError('invalid_response');
}
Perde stack trace e contexto. Propagar erro ou logar:
catch (e) {
  console.error('projetarAposta failed', e);
  throw new ApiError('invalid_response', { cause: e });
}

## identity query key instável se person null

const identity = [auth?.state.privateEpoch, auth?.state.person?.id]; → [epoch, undefined] se não autenticado. Query key muda entre renders. Usar:
const identity = [auth?.state.privateEpoch ?? 0, auth?.state.person?.id ?? 'anon'];

## changedDuringPagination acessa pages.at(-1) sem guarda

list.data?.pages.at(-1)?.pagination.total — se pages vazio, undefined. Adicionar guarda:
const lastPage = list.data?.pages.at(-1);
const total = lastPage?.pagination.total;
const changedDuringPagination = list.data?.pages.some(
  (page) => page.pagination.total !== total
);
